["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"K.C. Irving: Competing with Giants vertical integration Combines Investigation Act succession duties equal opportunity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-knowledge-政府想用遗产税拆散家族企业-他干脆移居百慕大保住控制权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d457e7b70836700-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:03:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>政府想用遗产税拆散家族企业，他干脆移居百慕大保住控制权</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">凯西·欧文六十年只信一条规则——重要的东西必须自己掌控。当新税制第一次威胁到这份100%所有权时，他选择带着全部财产离开新不伦瑞克。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">家族企业</span><span class=\"tag\">纵向整合</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Remembering Noah Adams Transgenic Pets pivot point sprinkler\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-throughline-战争博物馆里挂满英雄照-却没有一张受害者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>战争博物馆里挂满英雄照，却没有一张受害者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">诺亚·亚当斯90年代在贝尔格莱德军事博物馆的观察：两小时展品从九世纪弓箭到二战坦克，全是英雄影像，没有一张受害者照片——战争因此被讲述成了常态。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">NPR</span><span class=\"tag\">口述历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"513 为永明时代作传：林晓光谈南齐武帝萧赜与南朝文学的爆发 检籍 土断 黄籍/白籍 永明声律\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-cn2aa250-近体诗平仄格律-本质是贵族社会的等级礼仪搬进了诗歌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>近体诗平仄格律，本质是贵族社会的等级礼仪搬进了诗歌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">南齐永明年间发现汉语四声只是起点，真正让近体诗定型的是贵族社会要求人人恰如其分嵌入等级秩序这套逻辑——内容平庸也算诗，平仄不合就不算诗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">南北朝</span><span class=\"tag\">贵族社会</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"An Election Day Special With Nate Silver dummymander elasticity digital twin generic ballot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-oddlots-民调不是在低估共和党-而是在怕错而过度修正/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">42:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>民调不是在低估共和党，而是在怕错而过度修正</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">缅因州一份民调把民主党原始9个点的领先，硬是用「可能投票模型」压成2个点——Nate Silver说这不是技术失误，是民调机构怕重蹈2016年低估特朗普覆辙后的自我保护。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">民调方法论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Q&amp;A: How to know if my child may have depression? internalizing issue externalizing warm handoff genetic loading\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-secureattach-四岁孩子反复说自己难过长达数月-值得认真对待/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">24:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>四岁孩子反复说自己难过长达数月，值得认真对待</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一个四岁男孩连续数月说自己难过却说不清原因，心理学家认为这已够格去做专业评估——幼儿抑郁罕见但确实存在，而且可以治疗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">幼儿抑郁</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 226 Glanders: Straight from the horse’s mouth Burkholderia mallei Burkholderia pseudomallei Farcy Tier 1 select agent Koch&#x27;s postulates\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-tpwky-鼻疽至今没有疫苗-防控唯一办法就是扑杀所有感染动物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>鼻疽至今没有疫苗，防控唯一办法就是扑杀所有感染动物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这种专性寄生在马属动物体内的细菌致死率超过90%，对抗生素天生耐药，人类研究了一百多年，唯一拿得出手的办法还是「发现就杀」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">传染病</span><span class=\"tag\">兽医史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"296: Avoidance Feeds Anxiety: When to Make Teens Do Hard Things | Dr. Meredith Elkins exposure-based therapy accommodation SPACE program\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-asklisa-父母越是心疼着接送孩子逃避-焦虑就越难治好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bc857b2c3fda762e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">43:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>父母越是心疼着接送孩子逃避，焦虑就越难治好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">回避带来的轻松会让大脑记住「这件事我搞不定」,下次更想逃；真正管用的办法是分级直面让自己不舒服的事，这套框架对轻度紧张和临床焦虑症同样有效。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">焦虑障碍</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"When Toddlers Resist Absolutely Everything the untethered twos\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-unruffled-两岁娃的疯狂抵抗不是亲子关系出问题-而是情绪在自愈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">30:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>两岁娃的疯狂抵抗不是亲子关系出问题，而是情绪在自愈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">两岁孩子对上车、洗澡、牵手过马路样样说不，是因为经历巨变却毫无掌控感，这时该做的不是给更多选择，而是把边界收得更早更紧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">两岁儿童</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"“You’re Too Sensitive” Isn’t Helpful — Here’s What Is, with Dr. Sasha Hamdani RSD (Rejection Sensitive Dysphoria) amygdala prefrontal cortex DFK (deeply feeling kids) emotional vaccination\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-goodinside-怕被拒绝不是矫情-杏仁核过度警觉-前额叶跟不上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">49:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>怕被拒绝不是矫情：杏仁核过度警觉，前额叶跟不上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理医生 Sasha Hamdani 说：被拒绝的恐惧不是性格问题，而是杏仁核过度警觉、前额叶反应不足导致的真实神经反应，道理劝不醒它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">拒绝敏感性烦躁症</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building Legal Agents When You Can&#x27;t See the Data - Jacob Lauritzen, CTO of Legora Tabular Review Forward Deployed Engineer Legal Engineer Pareto frontier DPA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-latentspace-法律ai最大的工程难题不是模型-是永远看不到真实数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/927785d01eabb481-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>法律AI最大的工程难题不是模型，是永远看不到真实数据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">客户数据大多连律所自己都无权查看，Legora的evals团队只能靠分类和改写后的合成数据，去猜测律师们真实在做什么。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法律科技</span><span class=\"tag\">企业AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Robots Already Working in American Factories | Tutor Intelligence teleoperator / tutor greenfield market HRI(Human-Robot Interaction) action diffusion transformer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-a16z-机器人创业公司不卖ai-只卖-时薪16美元-这句话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>机器人创业公司不卖AI,只卖「时薪16美元」这句话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tutor向从未买过机器人的工厂主推销时，从不提模型和AI,只说一个数字——时薪16美元的机器人；这背后是美国一年仅部署3.8万台工业机器人、九成工厂空白的现实。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">制造业自动化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Onion Futures Act corner long position short position open interest\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-stuffmissed-两个农民囤光洋葱操纵期货-让国会专门立法禁掉了洋葱期货/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>两个农民囤光洋葱操纵期货，让国会专门立法禁掉了洋葱期货</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">两人联手买下芝加哥几乎全部洋葱、逼经销商签秘密协议，又反手做空把价格砸到历史最低，国会因此专门立法永久禁止洋葱做期货交易。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">期货监管</span><span class=\"tag\">市场操纵</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"373 | Colin Camerer on the Neuroscience of Economic Thinking mentalizing cognitive hierarchy model / level-k framing effect burstiness (Poisson non-homogeneity) Neural Autopilot model neural gaslighting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-mindscape-科学家让大鼠的大脑-骗-自己盐水很好喝/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>科学家让大鼠的大脑「骗」自己盐水很好喝</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究者用光遗传学上调大鼠脑内编码奖励信号的神经元，让它喝到讨厌的盐水时，大脑仍判定「这次很好」——感官与奖励信号可以被直接割裂。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行为经济学</span><span class=\"tag\">神经经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The $300 Billion Structured Notes Market Is Booming Vega Gamma Auto-callable Worst-of Knock-in / Knock-out Uridashi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-oddlots-3000亿美元结构票据市场-正在悄悄放大美股下跌的力道/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">51:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>3000亿美元结构票据市场，正在悄悄放大美股下跌的力道</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">标普、纳指、罗素挂钩的「表现最差者」自动赎回票据一旦不再按时敲出，交易商被迫同时抛售更多波动率敞口，而愿意接盘的做市商却在收缩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">结构票据</span><span class=\"tag\">衍生品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Airbnb CEO Brian Chesky: “I Was a Great Founder and a Terrible CEO” founder mode skip level\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-howibuilt-airbnb能活下来-是因为商业模式好到掩盖了管理混乱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c49ad29f2140d349-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>Airbnb能活下来，是因为商业模式好到掩盖了管理混乱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说Airbnb商业模式好到能掩盖管理混乱，直到疫情把公司逼到生死关头，他才被迫从放权转向事必躬亲的创始人模式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">领导力</span><span class=\"tag\">创始人模式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"20VC: Who Wins the Inference Market | Has Open-Source LLM Inference Peaked? | What Happens to the Cost of Compute | The Real Limits of Post-Training and RL with Erik Bernhardsson, Modal CEO NeoCloud PLG (Product-Led Growth) sandbox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-twentyvc-ai推理不再有90-毛利-每多一层供应商就分走利润/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/039f47c822a2df13-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>AI推理不再有90%毛利，每多一层供应商就分走利润</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一美元从客户流到英伟达手里，要经过应用、模型、基础设施、云等好几层，每层都切走20%到30%的毛利，这就是AI基础设施公司回不到软件黄金时代毛利率的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI推理</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Rise of Peter The Great Streltsi Grand Embassy knout fiscal-military state\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-historyhit-彼得大帝西游归来-只搬技术-绝口不提议会与自由/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9e331afa96f76fb1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">47:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>彼得大帝西游归来：只搬技术，绝口不提议会与自由</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他访问了光荣革命后的英国和共和制的荷兰，带回的只有造船术、刮胡刀新规和炮台图纸，议会与政治自由被原样留在了西欧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄国历史</span><span class=\"tag\">彼得大帝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 13: What Is Neuroaffirming ADHD Support? A Counselor Explains neuroaffirming interest-based nervous system MCAS Ehlers-Danlos syndrome executive function\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-parentmojo-adhd不是自控力缺陷-而是神经系统处理世界的方式不同/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">29:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>ADHD不是自控力缺陷，而是神经系统处理世界的方式不同</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主流框架把ADHD当作执行功能缺陷、靠自控力纠正；这位心理咨询师认为根源是注意力调节和感官系统天生不同，这套神经系统曾是人类赖以生存的优势。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">神经多样性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"719. Revolution in the Soviet Empire: The Hungarian Uprising (Part 1) Salami tactics AVH Secret Speech Petofi Circle 16 Points\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-restishistory-点燃匈牙利1956年革命的-是一群诗人作家办的辩论俱乐部/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7094b2e761027f4c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>点燃匈牙利1956年革命的，是一群诗人作家办的辩论俱乐部</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">十一年高压统治后，真正点燃起义的不是地下党或工人领袖，而是一群诗人作家办的公开辩论会，这说明拉科西政权早已只剩暴力，没有任何人心可守。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷战史</span><span class=\"tag\">苏联</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"409. JFK: The Cuban Missile Crisis (Part 3) ExComm / XCOM Trollope ploy Operation Mongoose Black Saturday soft power\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-empirehist-古巴导弹危机差点开打核战-全靠一名苏联军官投了反对票/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>古巴导弹危机差点开打核战，全靠一名苏联军官投了反对票</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">苏联核潜艇B-59上，三名军官里两人同意发射核鱼雷，唯独阿尔希波夫一人反对——这一票按苏联规定具有否决权，挡住了核战的引爆点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷战</span><span class=\"tag\">古巴导弹危机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Nathanael Greene 2: Logistics of War | | U.S. Revolutionary War History Quartermaster General Fighting Quaker\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-extracredits-独立战争最惨的两年-靠一位不想干后勤的人撑住/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">E</div><span class=\"dur\">16:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>独立战争最惨的两年，靠一位不想干后勤的人撑住</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">格林打赢过特伦顿和普林斯顿，也在布兰迪万和日耳曼敦吃了败仗，但真正让大陆军撑过去的，是他硬着头皮接下的后勤总管职位。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国独立战争</span><span class=\"tag\">后勤管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise of GLM and China’s Zhipu AI GLM (General Language Model) MoE (Mixture-of-Experts) Model-as-a-Service KEG (Knowledge Engineering Group) P2P (Paper to Product)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-asianometry-智谱研发支出是营收两倍-靠免费开源模型换增长能撑多久/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/701791e3cef20e9a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">22:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>智谱研发支出是营收两倍，靠免费开源模型换增长能撑多久</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智谱把最新模型全部开源免费发布，但研发支出已是营收的两倍——这桩靠烧钱换声量的生意能撑多久，是全篇最后抛出的真问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智谱AI</span><span class=\"tag\">开源大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"18